er":"Interrupt early","narration":"The first tool is the escape key. Boris Cherny's advice: no matter what the agent is doing, you can always safely hit escape. It won't corrupt anything. If nineteen of twenty lines look right, stop it, correct the one, and let it continue.","params":{"title":"~/app · interrupt and redirect","lines":[{"k":"tool","text":"Edit(src/db/users.ts)"},{"k":"agent","text":"I'll also migrate the sessions table to UUIDs while I'm here…","at":"agent is doing"},{"k":"warn","text":"⎋ interrupted by user","at":"hit escape"},{"k":"you","text":"no migrations in this task. keep the user fix only.","at":"nineteen"},{"k":"agent","text":"Got it. Reverting the sessions change, keeping the user fix.","at":"correct the one"},{"k":"ok","text":"PASS  31 tests","at":"continue"}]},"start":43.619,"dur":16.597,"words":[{"text":"The","s":43.919,"e":44.079},{"text":"first","s":44.199,"e":44.319},{"text":"tool","s":44.399,"e":44.719},{"text":"is","s":44.799,"e":44.879},{"text":"the","s":44.959,"e":45.039},{"text":"escape","s":45.279,"e":45.519},{"text":"key.","s":45.599,"e":46.159},{"text":"Boris","s":46.479,"e":46.799},{"text":"Cherny's","s":46.879,"e":47.199},{"text":"advice:","s":47.279,"e":48.039},{"text":"no","s":48.319,"e":48.399},{"text":"matter","s":48.479,"e":48.719},{"text":"what","s":48.799,"e":48.959},{"text":"the","s":49.039,"e":49.079},{"text":"agent","s":49.119,"e":49.439},{"text":"is","s":49.519,"e":49.599},{"text":"doing,","s":49.759,"e":50.079},{"text":"you","s":50.159,"e":50.239},{"text":"can","s":50.359,"e":50.479},{"text":"always","s":50.719,"e":50.959},{"text":"safely","s":51.039,"e":51.439},{"text":"hit","s":51.519,"e":51.599},{"text":"escape.","s":51.679,"e":52.479},{"text":"It","s":52.559,"e":52.639},{"text":"won't","s":52.679,"e":52.879},{"text":"corrupt","s":52.959,"e":53.279},{"text":"anything.","s":53.359,"e":54.319},{"text":"If","s":54.439,"e":54.559},{"text":"nineteen","s":54.639,"e":55.039},{"text":"of","s":55.119,"e":55.199},{"text"