:[{"from":3,"to":3,"at":"working state","label":"last good commit","tone":"good"},{"from":4,"to":4,"at":"bad changes","label":"revert this","tone":"bad"}],"caption":"Commit after every step that passes. Every commit is a save point."},"start":79.765,"dur":18.348,"words":[{"text":"Reverting","s":80.065,"e":80.625},{"text":"only","s":80.705,"e":80.945},{"text":"works","s":81.105,"e":81.505},{"text":"if","s":81.585,"e":81.665},{"text":"there's","s":81.745,"e":81.905},{"text":"something","s":82.065,"e":82.225},{"text":"to","s":82.305,"e":82.385},{"text":"revert","s":82.465,"e":82.785},{"text":"to.","s":82.865,"e":83.105},{"text":"In","s":83.665,"e":83.745},{"text":"Anthropic's","s":83.865,"e":84.465},{"text":"long-running","s":84.585,"e":85.025},{"text":"agent","s":85.105,"e":85.345},{"text":"experiments,","s":85.425,"e":86.385},{"text":"the","s":86.465,"e":86.625},{"text":"best","s":86.745,"e":86.865},{"text":"behavior","s":86.945,"e":87.425},{"text":"came","s":87.545,"e":87.665},{"text":"from","s":87.785,"e":87.905},{"text":"asking","s":87.985,"e":88.305},{"text":"the","s":88.345,"e":88.385},{"text":"model","s":88.465,"e":88.705},{"text":"to","s":88.785,"e":88.865},{"text":"commit","s":89.025,"e":89.185},{"text":"its","s":89.265,"e":89.345},{"text":"progress","s":89.425,"e":89.825},{"text":"to","s":89.865,"e":89.905},{"text":"git","s":90.065,"e":90.545},{"text":"with","s":90.625,"e":90.705},{"text":"descriptive","s":90.825,"e":91.265},{"text":"messages","s":91.345,"e":91.825},{"text":"after","s":91.905,"e":92.225},{"text":"each","s":92.305,"e":92.465},{"text":"step.","s":92.545,"e":93.425},{"text":"That","s":93.545,"e":93.665},{"text":"let","s":93.745,"e":93.825},{"text":"it","s":93.905,"e":93.985},{"text":"roll","s":94.105,"e":94.225},{"text":"back","s":94.345,"e":94.465},{"text":"bad","s":94.625,"e":94.785},{"text":"changes","s":95.065,"e":95.345},{"text":"and","s":95.425,"e":95.505},{"text":"recover","s":95.705,"e":95.905},{"text":"a","s":95.985,"e":96.065},{"text":"working","s":96.225,"e":96.385},{"text":"state","s":96.465,"e":96.705},{"text":"on","s":96.745,"e":96.785},{"text":"its","s":96.865,"e":97.025},{"text":"own.","s":97.145,"e":97.505}]},{"template":"chat","chapter":"Start fresh","narration":"And when a session has gone sour, don't argue with it. As we saw in lesson four, a history full of failures invites more failures. Ask for a summary of what was learned, clear the session, and start over with a better prompt.","params":{"messages":[{"from":"agent","text":"You're absolutely right! Let me try another approach…","tone":"bad","at":"gone sour"},{"from":"you","text":"Stop. Summarize what we tried, what failed and why, for a fresh agent.","at":"summary"},{"from":"you","text":"/clear  → paste summary + a better prompt","label":"fresh start","at":"start over"}]},"start":98.113,"dur":14.978,"words":[{"text":"And","s":98.413,"e":98.546},{"text":"when","s":98.573,"e":98.713},{"text":"a","s":98.733,"e":98.773},{"text":"session","s":98.813,"e":99.167},{"text":"has","s":99.213,"e":99.346},{"text":"gone","s":99.373,"e":99.583},{"text":"sour,","s":99.613,"e":100.093},{"text":"don't","s":100.493,"e":100.813},{"text":"argue","s":100.893,"e":101.213},{"text":"with","s":101.293,"e":101.373},{"text":"it.","s":101.453,"e":101.853},{"text":"As","s":102.093,"e":102.253},{"text":"we","s":102.333,"e":102.413},{"text":"saw","s":102.466,"e":102.573},{"text":"in","s":102.613,"e":102.653},{"text":"lesson","s":102.733,"e":102.973},{"text":"four,","s":103.133,"e":103.693},{"text":"a","s":103.773,"e":103.853},{"text":"history","s":103.933,"e":104.333},{"text":"full","s":104.493,"e":104.653},{"text":"of","s":104.733,"e":104.813},{"text":"failures","s":104.933,"e":105.373},{"text":"invites","s":105.453,"e":105.933},{"text":"more","s":106.093,"e":106.253},{"text":"failures.","s":106.413,"e":107.133},{"text":"Ask","s":107.373,"e":107.613},{"text":"for","s":107.653,"e":107.693},{"text":"a","s":107.773,"e":107.853},{"text":"summary","s":107.933,"e":10